# Status: TESTED AND WORKING (verified 2026-07-30) -- reasoning content, plain chat,
# AND tool_calls all confirmed working correctly over plain /v1/chat/completions.
# Qwen3.5-based MoE (vLLM resolves it as Qwen3_5MoeForConditionalGeneration --
# despite some HF docs describing it as dense, it is not), agentic-coding focused,
# has thinking mode (<think> block by default, surfaces cleanly in `reasoning`).
# Official FP8 release from deepreinforce-ai. 35.09GB weights, 61.37GB KV cache
# headroom at these settings (~3.1M token KV pool -- ~12x concurrency at full
# 262144 context). Uses a DIFFERENT tool-call-parser than our other Qwen-family
# models (qwen3_xml, not qwen3_coder) and needs --trust-remote-code (runs custom
# model code from the repo).
MODEL=deepreinforce-ai/Ornith-1.0-35B-FP8
MAX_MODEL_LEN=262144
GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION=0.85
EXTRA_ARGS="--enable-auto-tool-choice --tool-call-parser qwen3_xml --reasoning-parser qwen3 --enable-prefix-caching --trust-remote-code"
